# Deny by default; nothing is tracked unless a rule below names it.
#
# The usual shape of this file is the opposite -- list the junk, let everything
# else through -- and that shape has two failures this one does not. A new kind
# of file matches no rule and is one reflexive `git add` from the history. And
# the deny list is itself published: every path it names announces that such a
# file exists in the working tree, so excluding `PERSONAL.md` by name still
# tells a reader there is a `PERSONAL.md`.
#
# Inverted, a file nobody named does not get committed, and this file describes
# only what ships.
#
# The keep list names FILES, not extensions. A `!/shared/**/*.md` rule would be
# shorter and would re-admit any note dropped where Markdown legitimately lives,
# which is nearly every directory here.
#
# Git will not look inside a directory it has ignored, so each directory below
# is re-opened before its files are named back.
#
# Regenerate after adding files:
#   python3 <this script's path> <repo>
#
# Forgetting to regenerate does not silently drop a file from the release:
# install.py walks the payload on disk and refuses to install when it finds a
# file `git ls-files` does not list.

*


# ─── root ───
!/.gitignore
!/.pylintrc
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/pyrightconfig.json
!/requirements-dev.txt
!/requirements-test.txt
!/run_tests.py
!/setup.cfg

# ─── .github/workflows ───
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/dependabot.yml
!/.github/workflows/actionlint.yml
!/.github/workflows/audit.yml
!/.github/workflows/codeql.yml
!/.github/workflows/lint.yml
!/.github/workflows/release.yml
!/.github/workflows/tag.yml
!/.github/workflows/tests.yml
!/.github/workflows/types.yml

# ─── session_parsers ───
!/session_parsers/
!/session_parsers/__init__.py
!/session_parsers/parse_codex.py
!/session_parsers/parse_pi.py
!/session_parsers/parse_session.py
!/session_parsers/parse_wire.py

# ─── tests ───
!/tests/
!/tests/_util.py
!/tests/test_package_contract.py
!/tests/test_parse_codex.py
!/tests/test_parse_pi.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_cli.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_bg_tasks.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_bg_delivery.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_extract.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_latency.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_reports.py
!/tests/test_parse_session_reports_extra.py
